window.page7_callback(["<div class=\"newpage\" id=\"page7\" style=\"width: 902px; height:1167px\">\n<div class=text_layer style=\"z-index:2\"><div class=ie_fix>\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"ff1\" style=\"font-size:81px\">\n<span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:551px;word-spacing:6px\">representations of mental illness globally<span class=l10>. It’<span class=l6>s not just a research study; <span class=w style=\"width:20px\"></span>the aim of that project is</span></span></span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:668px;word-spacing:5px\">to critically examine the way mental health is represented in mass media</span><span class=a style=\"left:3099px;top:668px;color:#4d5156\"> — </span><span class=a style=\"left:3210px;top:668px;word-spacing:5px\"> in particular TV and</span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:785px;word-spacing:-1px;letter-spacing:1px\">film<span class=l6>, <span class=w6></span>but also in <span class=w8></span>plays, podcast<span class=l7>s, and <span class=w8></span>other media arts creative forms</span></span></span><span class=a style=\"left:2945px;top:785px;color:#4d5156\"> — </span><span class=a style=\"left:3055px;top:785px;word-spacing:1px;letter-spacing:1px\"> and how they tie into</span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:902px;word-spacing:5px\">dominant models and narratives of what mental health is, who’s responsible, how we treat it, and</span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:1019px;word-spacing:5px\">how those representations reflect and reinforce dominant narratives. The other part of the project</span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:1136px;word-spacing:5px\">is to scaffold the creation of new media that produces different kinds of narratives of mental</span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:1253px;word-spacing:5px\">health, ones that don't buy into the problematic aspects of those dominant narratives, and that</span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:1370px;word-spacing:5px\">represent people’s experiences in ways that are destigmatizing and really represent that</span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:1487px;word-spacing:5px\">continuum of experience that we discussed. We’re super excited about that project, and in the</span><span class=a style=\"left:530px;top:1604px;word-spacing:5px\">next year we’ll be doing some preliminary research and launching more fully after that.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=image_layer style=\"z-index: 1\">\n<div class=ie_fix>\n<img class=\"absimg\" style=\"left:-1px;top:-1px;width:904px;height:1169px;clip:rect(1px 903px 1168px 1px)\" orig=\"http://html.scribd.com/6ps8zd6edcbpi75s/images/7-867d19f00c.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n"]);